{"hw":"ἄρος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἄρος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἄρος</span> [<span class=\"gk\">α], <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">use, profit, help,</b> <abbr>f.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">885</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eust.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1422.19</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">ἄρ-νυμαι.</span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> = κοιλὰς ἐν αἷς ὕδωρ ἀθροίζεται ὁμόριον, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> = ἀκούσιον βλάβος, Id.; cf. <span class=\"gk\">ἀπαρές, ἀπηρής.</span> </div></div>"}